<mxfile host="www.iodraw.com" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/155.0.0.0 Safari/537.36" version="24.7.17" pages="3">
  <diagram id="wdxr-ksmw0wqOJfV0Th9" name="Page-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1313" dy="696" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="EH43Kf83GVdlbr7WDXlS-1" value="&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;Agam RTK Base – Standalone RTK Testing&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=23;fontStyle=4" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="30" width="490" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EH43Kf83GVdlbr7WDXlS-2" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;1. Test Objectives&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;To evaluate two Agam RTK Base devices configured as Base and Rover, and verify that the Rover achieves an &lt;strong&gt;RTK Fixed&lt;/strong&gt; solution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;To operate the Base independently using battery power and transmit RTCM corrections through wireless telemetry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;To use &lt;strong&gt;u-blox u-center 2&lt;/strong&gt; exclusively for configuration, monitoring, and data logging.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="75" width="760" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LBVvRoIkureotuKAEjZE-1" value="&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;2. Test Setup&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The test setup, connections, and GNSS configurations are illustrated in the diagram on the following page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="215" width="590" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LBVvRoIkureotuKAEjZE-2" value="&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;3. GNSS Module Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;RTK Base Station&lt;/strong&gt; was battery-powered and operated without a PC connection. Survey-In parameters and RTCM outputs were&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;configured&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;beforehand using u-center 2 via USB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;RTK Rover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; was connected to a PC through USB for monitoring and logging,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;while&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;RTCM corrections&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;were received through wireless telemetry on UART1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since the Sik telemetry modules used here operate at &lt;strong&gt;57600 baud&lt;/strong&gt;, UART1 on both GNSS modules was configured to 57600.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All relevant configuration settings are shown in the test setup diagram.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="310" width="730" height="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LBVvRoIkureotuKAEjZE-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;4. Test Observations&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;After completing Survey-In, the Base began transmitting RTCM corrections through telemetry. Within a few seconds, the Rover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;achieved&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;RTK Fixed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;, with a significant improvement in reported positioning accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Rover&#39;s blue LED indicated the RTK status:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blinking:&lt;/strong&gt; RTK Float&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid ON:&lt;/strong&gt; RTK Fixed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Data Logging&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;GNSS parameters, including latitude, longitude, altitude, timestamp, satellite count, and accuracy estimates, were recorded using the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Table View&lt;/strong&gt; in u-center 2 and exported as CSV.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="540" width="730" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LBVvRoIkureotuKAEjZE-4" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="39.16" y="830" width="751.67" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
